{
  "_about": [
    "Every page in the SPA and the feature id that licences it.",
    "Put the ids from 'features' into the 'features' array of sites/<site>/license.json;",
    "granting one id unlocks every page listed under it in 'pages_by_feature'.",
    "A page whose feature is null is never checked against the licence.",
    "Generated from frontend/src/router.js, frontend/src/composables/usePermission.js",
    "and DASHBOARD_TILES in ssplbilling/setup.py — regenerate after adding a page.",
    "Use [\"*\"] to grant everything, including pages added later.",
    "features_by_category groups the same ids in \"features\" for licence picking; \"features\" itself stays a flat sorted array because the signature is computed over it."
  ],
